---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro'
import YouTube from '../../components/YouTube.astro'
import Gallery from '../../components/Gallery.astro'
import PortraitCard from '../../components/PortraitCard.astro'
import { galleryByYear } from '../../data/galleries'
import { programs } from '../../data/programs'
---

<Base title="Media - European Ordination Program"
  description="Photographs and films from the European Ordination Program.">
  <div class="container mt-5">
    <h1 class="display-2 pt-5">
      European Ordination Program 2026
    </h1>
    <p>
      The European Ordination Program for 2026 was held in Wat Phra Dhammakaya Belgium, between
      8<sup>th</sup>-28<sup>th</sup> June 2026.
    </p>
    <div class="row">
      <div class="col-12 p-3">
        <YouTube id="mA6R8_K2Kb0" title="European Ordination Program 2026" />
      </div>
    </div>
    <Gallery gallery={galleryByYear.get(2026)!} priority />
    <div class="row">
      <div class="col-12 p-3">
        <YouTube id="QC0HZYnOhaE" title="European Ordination Program 2026 highlights" />
      </div>
    </div>

    <h1 class="display-2 pt-5">
      European Ordination Program 2025
    </h1>
    <p>
      The 2025 European Ordination program took place in June with 13 participants travelling across Europe to participate
      in London.
    </p>
    <Gallery gallery={galleryByYear.get(2025)!} />

    <h1 class="display-2 mt-5">
      European Ordination Program 2023
    </h1>
    <p>
      Between 8<sup>th</sup>-30<sup>th</sup> July 2023, the ninth group of the European Ordination Program participants
      were ordinated at Wat Phra Dhammakaya Belgium and trained by experienced teaching monks at Wat Dhammakaya Korsør
      Lystskov.
    </p>
    <Gallery gallery={galleryByYear.get(2023)!} />

    <h1 class="display-2 mt-5">2022</h1>
    <p>
      Between 3<sup>rd</sup>-19<sup>th</sup> June 2022, the eighth group of European Ordination Program participants were
      trained under the guidance of several experienced teaching monks at the Dhammakaya Korsør Lystskov Thai temple. In
      total, ten participants joined to train themselves in the monastic discipline, sleeping in simple tents and
      practicing meditation intensively for a period of two weeks. The program was a great success this year, and many of
      the participants have indicated they would like the program to be held longer and would not want to miss it next
      year.
    </p>
    <Gallery gallery={galleryByYear.get(2022)!} />

    <h1 class="display-2 mt-5">2019</h1>
    <p>
      20 people took part in the program which took place over 4 weeks, between 17th June and 14th July 2019.
    </p>
    <Gallery gallery={galleryByYear.get(2019)!} />

    <h1 class="display-2 mt-5">2018</h1>
    <p>
      The program took place over two weeks, starting on the 4th June, and ending on the 15th June 2018. A total of 25
      people took part from 10 countries all over europe.
    </p>
    <div class="row">
      {programs[2018]!.map((person) => (
        <div class="col-6 col-sm-4 col-md-3 col-lg-2 text-center">
          <PortraitCard person={person} />
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
